1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,823
Here is the whole system on one slide.

2
00:00:02,823 --> 00:00:05,948
The founder gives a website and a shareholder list.

3
00:00:05,948 --> 00:00:12,133
AI agents read up to six pages and run three searches, and a fixed formula computes the value.

4
00:00:12,133 --> 00:00:14,268
The agents hold no keys.

5
00:00:14,268 --> 00:00:16,964
A human admin signs one approval.

6
00:00:16,964 --> 00:00:25,844
Only then does the isolated issuer, the only component with a key, create the register on our zero-gas chain and mirror it to Ethereum and HashKey.

7
00:00:25,844 --> 00:00:31,195
The proof: tokens in MetaMask, a verify page, and a public explorer.

